{
  "name": "AI Email Agent — Analyze, Report & Reply",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Attachment analysis:\n\"Inspect Attachments\" classifies the first attachment. Images -> \"Analyze Image\" (AI vision), PDFs -> \"Extract PDF Text\", other/none -> a note. The result feeds AI Analysis. Only the FIRST attachment is analyzed.\n\nDecision routing (3 outcomes):\n- reply -> \"Send Reply\" (auto-sent)\n- draft -> \"Create Draft\" (important, saved for your approval)\n- trash -> \"Move to Trash\" (no reply needed; recoverable 30 days, NOT permanent delete)\n\nEdit the DELIVERY DECISION RULES in the \"AI Analysis\" System Message to tune which emails are replied / drafted / trashed. A report email is always sent to you."
      },
      "id": "98315796-badb-44b9-bc54-ebf32907b63a",
